---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
// Usando as imagens que sabemos que existem
import print1 from '../../assets/images/Prints/depoimento_ntr_1.png';
import print2 from '../../assets/images/Prints/depoimento_ntr_2.png';
import print3 from '../../assets/images/Prints/depoimento_ntr_3.png';

// Se tiverem mais prints depois, podem ser importados aqui
---

<section class="py-24 bg-[#050505] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl text-center">
    
    <div class="mb-16 reveal-up">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-2">
        NÃO É UM. NÃO SÃO DOIS.
      </h2>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-brand-red uppercase tracking-tight">
        SÃO CENTENAS.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-6 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Veja o que acontece com a oficina de quem decide parar de apostar na sorte e começa a aplicar o método NTR na prática.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Masonry Grid (simulado com colunas do Tailwind) */}
    <div class="columns-1 md:columns-2 lg:columns-3 gap-6 space-y-6 reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
      
      <div class="break-inside-avoid rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-xl hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-colors">
        <Image src={print1} alt="Depoimento Aluno 1" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>
      
      <div class="break-inside-avoid rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-xl hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-colors">
        <Image src={print2} alt="Depoimento Aluno 2" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>
      
      <div class="break-inside-avoid rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-xl hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-colors">
        <Image src={print3} alt="Depoimento Aluno 3" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-xl hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-colors">
        <Image src={print1} alt="Depoimento Aluno 4" class="w-full h-auto opacity-80" />
      </div>
      
      <div class="break-inside-avoid rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-xl hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-colors">
        <Image src={print2} alt="Depoimento Aluno 5" class="w-full h-auto opacity-80" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-xl hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-colors">
        <Image src={print3} alt="Depoimento Aluno 6" class="w-full h-auto opacity-80" />
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 reveal-up">
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm italic">Estes são apenas alguns dos mais de 12.000 alunos transformados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
